  "policy": "CENTER remains enum/property-admissible, but has no documented corner geometry and left x/y unassigned. Define deterministic no-ink/no-extents, not a centered rectangle. All directional cases remain unchanged.",
  "old_callers": "Only draw-tool wrapper calls factory. Rectangle-tool resize anchors map eight directional modes; default mapper returns CENTER but has no specified corner semantics. Explicit creation uses NW NE SW SE.",
  "current_callers": "Only tool-widget wrapper calls factory. Rectangle-widget construction loops exactly eight resize directions; center control uses separate CROSS handle.",
  "evidence_scope": "Source audit and observed empty output, not memory-sanitizer proof of an observed uninitialized read. Initial nonempty expectation was invalid for unsupported CENTER and is retained as diagnostic."
